# Code ownership for vstore-front.
#
# These rules identify the people who should review a PR. GitHub will enforce
# them only when the main branch ruleset enables "Require review from Code
# Owners" and direct pushes to main are disabled.

# Product ownership: storefront source, assets and documentation.
*                           @alex-vitup @leskovivan
/src/                       @alex-vitup @leskovivan
/public/                    @alex-vitup @leskovivan
/docs/                      @alex-vitup @leskovivan

# DevOps-owned release and edge-proxy mechanics. These rules are deliberately
# later because the last matching rule wins in CODEOWNERS.
/.github/                   @dumpe2fs
/nginx/                     @dumpe2fs
/Dockerfile*                @dumpe2fs
/.dockerignore              @dumpe2fs
/docker-compose*            @dumpe2fs
